                       CRInputDeviceController, CRInputDeviceManager, CRKeyStrokeMonitor, 
                       CRLASController, CRLASStatus, CRLocalization, CRLogicBoardStatus, 
                       CRMesaController, CRMobileAsset, CRNVRAMController, CRPatchUtils, 
                       CRPersonalizationElement, CRPersonalizationManager, CRPreflightController, 
                       CRPreflightHelper, CRPreflightRequest, CRPreflightRequestComponent, 
                       CRPreflightUtils, CRRepairHistory, CRRepairHistoryItem, CRRepairReport, 
                       CRRepairStateSnapshot, CRRepairStatusLite, CRSalvageStatus, 
                       CRShipModeBatteryClient, CRShipModeServerNotifier, CRShipModeServerResponse, 
